#import "../../../../../shared/environments.typ": *

==== Participants

    - n=75 ME/CFS patients enrolled (ages 18–60), to yield approximately 50 high-affinity TSPO binders for the primary analysis
    - n=25 healthy comparator participants, sedentary and matched on objectively measured activity (7-day accelerometry)
    - Documented PEM with variable severity trajectories (stable, slowly progressive, rapidly progressive)
    - Mild to moderate severity (able to tolerate imaging procedures)
    - Disease duration $gt.eq$6 months
    - No contraindications to PET imaging
    - rs6971 genotype measured at screening; the primary analysis includes high-affinity binders only
    - Mixed- and low-affinity binders (expected n≈25) are retained in a pre-specified secondary stratum
